<title>USA: IPO FILING - Radiant Systems Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Radiant Systems Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Radiant Systems Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			RADS.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-$12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.95 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  450,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    10,983,701</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  442,500 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Radiant, of Alpharetta, Ga., provides enterprise-wide technology solutions to selected vertical markets with the retail industry.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Repayment of indebtedness, repurchase of outstanding shares of common stock and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year N/A</p>
